OL,3,GNEWSAFears for future of schools as
OL,4,Acity's pupil numbers set to drop by 17%
OL,5,
OL,6,FExperts have warned that a projected
OL,7,F15% reduction in Welsh pupils between
OL,8,F2025-2041 may mean more closures or
OL,9,Fmergers and a quarter of school places
OL,10,Funfilled in some councils in 2024.
